      "level": "h1",
      "text": "Stories from the SOFO Archives: Flight Lieutenant Bernard “Pop” Green RAFVR, MC"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "text": "Decorated Great War Officer in the Ox & Bucks, and in the Second World War, a Great Escaper and Long March Survivor"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Lt. Bernard 'Pop' Green in the Bucks Battalion"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "text": "Pop Green and Johnnie Dodge at Sagan, circa 1943"
    },
